<PageLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How American Car Saga earns money.">
  <p>{SITE.name} is reader-supported. Some links on this website are affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission from the retailer <strong>at no additional cost to you</strong>.</p>
  <p>{SITE.name} may participate in affiliate programs such as the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
  <h2>How we choose products</h2>
  <p>Commissions never decide our opinions. We recommend products based on research, owner feedback and, where possible, hands-on use. If a product has drawbacks, we say so.</p>
  <h2>Sponsored content</h2>
  <p>When a brand pays for an article or video, it is clearly labeled “Sponsored”.</p>
  <p>Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
